{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And when she arose</b> — punctuate on the vav, to say that she lay with him before six hours and before midnight, while his sleep was still strong, and therefore he did not know when she arose. But Ruth did not lie with Boaz except after six hours, as it is written: \"and she rose before a man could recognize his fellow\" — in the vav, that she did not rise until after six hours; therefore he knew when she arose."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:30.962985230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}